# Bailey Systems AI — Project Rules

## ABSOLUTE RULES — NEVER BREAK

1. **NEVER touch `middleware.ts`** — handles auth routing for all protected pages
2. **NEVER touch `lib/email.ts`** — transactional email (Resend), used site-wide
3. **NEVER touch `lib/stripe.ts` or `lib/stripe-links.ts`** — Stripe billing logic
4. **NEVER touch `app/api/stripe/webhook/route.ts`** — processes live Stripe payments
5. **NEVER touch `app/page.tsx`** — homepage, do not modify layout or assets
6. **NEVER touch `public/` images or videos** — live homepage assets
7. **NEVER push without user approval** — always show changes first
8. **ALWAYS 0 TypeScript errors** — run `npm run build` before approving push

